---
title: A coding font journey
description: A personal journey through coding fonts, from Consolas on Windows to Monaco on macOS, bitmap fonts on Linux, and putting together my own OCR-based monospace font.
date: 2026-03-14T10:00
tags: fonts, dotfiles
